  "description": "Fuaran.Core.Text — the text kernel below Tree, Wire and OpStream: the FNV-1a cache hash and the pinned pure SHA-256 digest, the typed Digest, the UTF-8 encoding and the UTF-16 well-formedness rule, the one JSON string escape (live and frozen legacy), the strict lexical grammar of a JSON string and number token, and the encoding profiles. Every byte the spine hashes, escapes or scans is produced here, once. FSharp.Core only, Fable-clean.",
